0127 again (reverted as 86bfba3 after box 52112), with the fix for what
the tester found. The helper's line „კი, თამუნა მოგონილი ნოტარიუსია, ჩემი
სახელით დაუკავშირდი." read as an order to ask whose addressee came out as
garbage, so no card was shown, and the helper's own run called relay_ask:
the recommended person was asked before any tap.

- A line that recommends getting in touch with somebody (დაუკავშირდი,
  მიწერე, დაურეკე, მიმართე, contact her, talk to…) and names exactly one
  of the helper's own contacts gets the 1696 card; a line the order
  reading finds nobody in is read as a recommendation.
- A reader's run whose line refers the asker to somebody does not hold
  relay_ask: the card relays on the tap, or nothing does.

